[The Q Movement Is Off Track]

I'm going to explain why I think our movement is off track, but first I want to make it very clear that this post isn't a shot at anyone. I'm not trying to be an all knowing Anon. Everyone is free to believe what they want. My prospective comes from my experience as an OG Anon. I watched the Q drops in real time. I wasn't a decoder, but I watched the decodes drop also.

While you read this post understand that our mission as Anons is to Red Pill people (wake them up) & combat the Mainstream Media, propaganda, & PSYOPs. When it comes to Red Pilling optics are very important. That's my angle all the time. Mission first...

We are in the "future proves past" phase. I say that because pretty much all the Q posts have already been decoded. The picture has been painted & the Anons mission mapped out. All that's left is future proves past & comms. For example, "the picture is the signifier" is Q baby. That was a proof that already played out & was also confirmed by Trump in a video after it happened. That proof doesn't apply to every attention grabbing picture. If there was more to that proof it would link directly to something in the proof itself. That would be the rally, the baby, or the account (Q_ANONBaby) used to link the proof together. I'm not saying Anons were right about every single thing, but the OG Anon didn't get it wrong. Confirming information is the only proof we should be worried about at this stage (future proves past). In my opinion there are no "new decodes". We have all the information & decodes as base used to connect the dots.

When it comes to comms people need to be more realistic. Q said "no outside comms". Now that Q is done posting, Trump & select people would be the only group that's not "outside comms". If Q is a small group of less than 10 people, there definitely isn't 20 people dropping comms. Remember, anyone can drop a timestamp to match up with Q posts. Also, sometimes it really is just a coincidence. Because it's in the political realm topics are in the same lane, & because we are circling back to older information (for Anons) info will line up. There are almost 5000 posts about everything we're exposing. That's a lot of timestamps. Sometimes things will just line themselves up. (it's not impossible). Everything & everyone isn't comms. Trump, Scavino, & the accounts from his admin that Q posted are the only ones I would follow for comms (but not every post). Even Elon is a big maybe for me. As far as Mainstream, Q told us to watch John Solomon, Sarah Carter, & Hannity. They aren't part of the Q team, just relaying uncovered information. If any comms were going to come through the mainstream I think it would be through John Solomon. As far as accounts on X. They aren't part of the Q team. Some of them want you to think they're an insider but they aren't. They do that to grow their account because people fall for it (it works). No matter how much you like them, or how good the information is, they are not part of the Q team. Look at all the JFK Jr accounts as an example. None of them are JFK Jr or "Q". Q isn't going to jump on social media & start posting as Q.
